# The repository owner holds every area until the governance roles register
# (docs/governance/roles-register.md) names the Integration/API Owner,
# Information Security Lead, Data Steward and module owners; then replace the
# owner here with their GitHub accounts or teams. These rules take effect
# when branch protection requires code-owner review on main.

